.Dd October 19, 2026
.Dt PATINA-DICTATE 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm patina-dictate
.Nd speech to text on the machine, with Whisper
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl v
.Op Fl m Ar model
.Op Fl l Ar language
.Op Ar file.wav
.Nm
.Fl d
.Op Fl v
.Op Fl m Ar model
.Op Fl l Ar language
.Nm
.Fl -overlay Cm bottom | top
.Nm
.Fl h | V
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
records from the microphone until Enter is pressed, or its standard input
ends, and prints what was said.
Given
.Ar file.wav ,
it prints what's said in that instead.
Everything is transcribed on the machine, by Whisper through whisper.cpp;
nothing is sent anywhere.
It runs on the GPU through Vulkan where there's a driver for it (Intel,
AMD or NVIDIA), and on the CPU otherwise.
.Pp
What Whisper takes to be no speech is left out, so silence prints an empty
line.
.Pp
With
.Fl d ,
it's dictation on the desktop:
.Xr patina-compositor 1
starts it and keeps it running, and while the
.Ic dictate
key (Ctrl+Super+Alt) is held it records; when the key comes up, what was said
is typed into the focused window.
A press under a third of a second is taken as a slip.
Meanwhile an overlay shows at the bottom or top of the screen: a waveform
that follows the voice, then a spinner while the words are transcribed.
.Pp
On Linux it records from the default input, through ALSA, which PipeWire
and PulseAudio serve.
On
.Fx
it reads
.Pa /dev/dsp ,
whatever sound server runs.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl d , -daemon
Dictation behind the compositor's
.Ic dictate
key, signalled on the session bus
.Pq com.sectorflabs.Patina.Input ;
the text is typed by its Commit.
The settings in the config file are read at each press: a changed model or language
is loaded then, and a model that wouldn't load is tried again.
It ends when the compositor leaves the bus, and won't start without it.
.It Fl -overlay Cm bottom | top
The overlay alone, at that edge, which
.Fl d
starts at each press.
It reads its input a line at a time: a number is the loudness now (RMS,
from 0), and
.Ql transcribing
ends the listening; at the end of its input it fades out.
.It Fl m , -model Ar model
The model, by whisper.cpp's name for it
.Pq Ql base.en , Ql small , Ql large-v3-turbo ,
kept in the models folder as
.Pa ggml- Ns Ar model Ns Pa .bin ;
or a path to the file.
Over
.Ic model
in the config file; the default is base.en.
.It Fl l , -language Ar code
What's spoken
.Pq Ql en , Ql sv ,
or
.Ql auto
to detect it.
English for an English-only model
.Pq Ql *.en ,
else
.Ql auto .
Over
.Ic language
in the config file.
.It Fl v , -verbose
whisper.cpp's log, with the GPU it found, if any, the sound's length, rate and loudness, and how long
each step took, on standard error.
.It Fl h , -help
Print usage and exit.
.It Fl V , -version
Print the version and exit.
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Pa $XDG_DATA_HOME/patina-dictate/models
The models, downloaded from
.Lk https://huggingface.co/ggerganov/whisper.cpp .
.It Pa $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/patina-dictate/config.toml
Read at each press:
.Bl -tag -width Ds -compact
.It Ic overlay
.Ql \(dqbottom\(dq
or
.Ql \(dqtop\(dq :
where the overlay shows.
.It Ic model , language
As
.Fl m
and
.Fl l .
.It Ic beam_size
1 to 8: candidates the decoder weighs; 1 is the fastest, more is steadier on accents and mumbling.
Default 1.
.It Ic no_speech
0 to 1: segments likelier than this to be no speech are dropped.
Default 0.6.
.It Ic prompt
Words Whisper is told came before, to lean it towards names and spellings.
.It Ic threads
Decoder threads; 0, the default, for as many as there are, up to eight.
.It Ic fallback
Retry unsure passages with some randomness; default true.
.El
.Xr patina-settings 1 Ns 's
Dictation page writes it.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh EXAMPLES
The overlay, without dictating:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
(for i in $(seq 60); do echo 0.0$((RANDOM % 9)); sleep 0.03; done;
 echo transcribing; sleep 1) | patina-dictate --overlay bottom
.Ed
.Pp
Dictate to the clipboard:
.Dl patina-dictate | wl-copy
.Pp
A recording in Swedish, with a multilingual model:
.Dl patina-dictate -m small -l sv talk.wav
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr patina-compositor 1 ,
.Xr patina-settings 1 ,
.Xr patina-desktop 7
